From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:21:32 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: mock desktop Chrome Web Share with native validation

Expose secure-context, Window-only Navigator.canShare and Navigator.share
through native V8 bindings for the existing desktop Mac Chrome persona.
No OS dialog, native application, recipient, file write or real sharing is
implemented: permitted valid requests asynchronously reject with AbortError
as a cancelled share, never as successful delivery.

Convert ShareData in WebIDL member order, retaining getter/coercion/iterator
exceptions as share promise rejections and closing failed File iterables.
Validate recognized fields and relative URLs against the receiver document.
Follow Chromium's distinction between basic canShare validation and share's
activation-gated title/text/URL, file-count, byte-budget and file-safety checks.

Apply the web-share Permissions-Policy subset (self/origin lists, wildcard,
iframe allow self/src/none and delegation), active receiver checks, five-second
trusted-input activation and whole-tree consumption. Compatibility mousedown
must not restore activation consumed by its preceding pointerdown. Keep
per-Navigator pending state and finalize queued cancellations on teardown.
Store rejection exceptions in the page factory so retained cross-realm errors
outlive their original context. Hide/restore both native methods during
secure-context transitions without exposing them on WorkerNavigator.

Existing upstream tests: 1658/1658 passed. Temporary ignored CDP diagnostics
cover conversion, security, policy, keyboard/pointer activation, cancellation,
retained errors/navigation, File iterators, worker absence and descriptors;
88/88 passed. No upstream tests or benchmark predicates were added/changed.

References:
https://w3c.github.io/web-share/
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chromium/chromium/main/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webshare/navigator_share.idl
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chromium/chromium/main/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webshare/navigator_share.cc
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chromium/chromium/main/chrome/browser/webshare/share_service_impl.cc
